# Route: guide 29 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 51 to
# 53, 27 quests, 3.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands): Light's Hope
# Chapel -> Darrowshire -> The Undercroft -> Terrordale -> Light's Hope Chapel
# -> Stonard -> Splinterspear Junction -> Stonard -> Stagalbog -> Stonard ->
# Pool of Tears -> Stonard -> Splinterspear Junction -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein (6163), Dead
# Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948).

